msgid "Do You Agree to the License?"
msgstr "Souhlasíte s licencí?"

#: appinstaller.rs:821
msgid "To continue installing, you must agree to the terms of the software license agreement."
msgstr "Chcete-li pokračovat v instalaci, musíte souhlasit s podmínkami licenční smlouvy k softwaru."

